251	$P$ & DAF($P$) & 95\% CI \\
252	\midrule
253	0 & 7.5\% & [$-36.7$, $83.1$] \\
254	10 & 50.4\% & [$19.8$, $94.5$] \\
255	25 & 70.8\% & [$48.5$, $97.1$] \\
256	50 & 82.6\% & [$67.6$, $98.4$] \\
